{'symbol': 'OTIS', 'date': '2021-12-08 16:10:00', 'title': 'PRESIDENT AND CEO JUDY MARKS ELECTED AS CHAIR OF OTIS WORLDWIDE CORPORATION', 'text': "FARMINGTON, CONN., DEC. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 OTIS WORLDWIDE CORP. \xa0(NYSE: OTIS), THE WORLD'S LEADING COMPANY FOR ELEVATOR AND ESCALATOR MANUFACTURING, INSTALLATION AND SERVICE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT\xa0ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED JUDY MARKS \xa0AS ITS CHAIR, EFFECTIVE FEBRUARY 3, 2022."}